<article class="env-definition" id="0DEA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DEA">Definition <span data-tag="0DEA">87.34.1</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be a formal algebraic space with reduction $X_{red}$ (Lemma <a href="/tag/0AIN" data-tag="0AIN">87.12.1</a>). </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
The <em>small étale site</em> $X_{\acute{e}tale}$ of $X$ is the site $X_{red, {\acute{e}tale}}$ of Properties of Spaces, Definition <a href="/tag/03ED" data-tag="03ED">66.18.1</a>. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
The site $X_{spaces, {\acute{e}tale}}$ is the site $X_{red, spaces, {\acute{e}tale}}$ of Properties of Spaces, Definition <a href="/tag/03G0" data-tag="03G0">66.18.2</a>. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
The site $X_{affine, {\acute{e}tale}}$ is the site $X_{red, affine, {\acute{e}tale}}$ of Properties of Spaces, Lemma <a href="/tag/04JS" data-tag="04JS">66.18.6</a>. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
